<mj-section padding="0px">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text>Hi {{ user.name }},</mj-text>
    <mj-text>I hope you've taken a bit of time to look around the Couchers.org platform!</mj-text>
    <mj-text>We would love to ask one quick favor of you: please take a moment to fill out your profile by adding a photo and some text.</mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section padding="0px">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-button background-color="#00a398" color="white" border-radius="5px" href="{{ edit_profile_link }}">
      <b>Go to edit your profile</b>
    </mj-button>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section padding="0px">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text>A big problem that some platforms have is that there are so many empty accounts, and we really want to avoid that!</mj-text>
    <mj-text>We would really appreciate it if you could add a photo and fill in at least the "Who I am" section of your profile, although a full profile would be even better! It's an easy way to help showcase the amazing community we're building together, and it means you'll be fully ready to connect, host, or surf as the community thrives.</mj-text>
    <mj-text>Thank you so much!<br />Emily from Couchers.org<br /><a href="mailto:community@couchers.org">community@couchers.org</a><br /><br /><a href="https://couchers.org/user/emily">https://couchers.org/user/emily</a></mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
